# BMI Calculator

## Oasis Infobyte Python Programming Internship

### Task 2 - BMI Calculator

This is a simple BMI Calculator created using Python and Tkinter.

## Features
- User-friendly GUI
- Name input
- Weight input
- Height input
- BMI Calculation
- BMI Category Display

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Tkinter

